            If quiet is the priority, buy the Honda EU2200i in the small class, the Westinghouse iGen5000 or Honda EU3200i in the middle, and the Honda EU7000iS if you need large-generator output. If budget matters more than the last few decibels, the WEN 56235i gets you most of the way for much less.
          </p>
